Opt-in storage-capable Vulkan canvas allocation matches browser resolve targets.
Actual image-format and surface capabilities gate the extra allocation usage;
SDL public usage flags, storage binding restrictions and default allocation
remain unchanged. The PAL opts in only for Linux canvas surfaces and resolves.

